<LegalPage
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy"
  description="What data acabreram.com processes and how to exercise your rights."
  updated="Last updated: 12 October 2026"
>
  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>This website uses no cookies, has no forms or user accounts, and shares no data with ad networks.</p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>Alejandro Cabrera Martínez · <a href="mailto:alex@acabreram.com">alex@acabreram.com</a></p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. To serve it and protect it from attacks, Cloudflare processes
    technical data from each visit, such as the IP address and browser, as a data processor. Cloudflare
    takes part in the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework for international transfers.
  </p>

  <h2>Visit statistics</h2>
  <p>
    I use Cloudflare Web Analytics to see which pages are read. It uses no cookies and doesn't identify
    people: it only reports aggregate figures such as page views, country or browser type.
  </p>

  <h2>Fonts and images</h2>
  <p>Fonts and images are served from this domain, with no calls to Google Fonts or other services.</p>

  <h2>If you write to me</h2>
  <p>If you email me, I use your address and what you tell me only to reply. Email is hosted on Microsoft 365.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request access to, correction or deletion of your data, or object to its processing, by
    writing to <a href="mailto:alex@acabreram.com">alex@acabreram.com</a>. If you think your rights
    haven't been respected, you can complain to the Spanish Data Protection Agency
    (<a href="https://www.aepd.es" rel="noreferrer">aepd.es</a>).
  </p>
</LegalPage>
